   {
    "as": "user",
    "status": 403
   },
   {
    "as": "admin",
    "status": 404,
    "path": "/api/admin/subscription-plans/999999",
    "note": "NOT_FOUND"
   },
   {
    "as": "admin",
    "status": 409,
    "bug": "the in-use guard counts only status='active' subscriptions (routes/admin.js:373-376), so a plan whose subscribers are on trial (FREE) goes on to the DELETE; the FK user_subscriptions_plan_id_fkey refuses it (23503) and adminErrorHandler reports that as 400 INVALID_INPUT 'Referenced resource does not exist' (middleware/admin-error-handler.js:165-169) - should be 409 CONFLICT, plan still has subscriptions",
    "note": "safe: the FK makes the DELETE fail atomically, the FREE plan stays"
   }
  ]
 },
